{"id": "1545352703939579984", "channel_id": "1545352703939579984", "author_id": "1231540652253253705", "author_name": "menoctus", "content": "> 大家好，这里是难忘今宵攻略组。本期给大家带来的是星辰篇·第6章的流程图，根据更新内容分为2张图。\n以及无提示事件「山的秘密」。\n本事件出现在关卡6-16，战斗波次1-2之间。\n\n请注意：\n【褪色遗骨】取代「联络点」成为关卡中的主要回复生命的遭遇。\n【灰烬遗迹】取代「融痕」成为关卡中的主要购买造物的遭遇。并且，效果也与「忘却篇」不同，注意公告与游戏内容。\n部分关卡中将不再有探索地图，取而代之的是一连串无法回头的遭遇路线。", "timestamp": "2026-09-04T08:39:55.884000+00:00", "thread_id": "1545352703939579984", "attachments": [{"id": "1545352704744890378", "filename": "008CCOGHgy1igpakkkemkj32569ed1ky.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 2138575, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1545352703939579984/1545352704744890378/008CCOGHgy1igpakkkemkj32569ed1ky.jpg?ex=6a9bd55c&is=6a9a83dc&hm=ce03a1b931dde4f1394f7c5eb098b79b020103b2203f8dd3d9e078511effe57b&"}, {"id": "1545352705571037275", "filename": "008CCOGHgy1igpakklklmj32569ed1ky.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 2183219, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1545352703939579984/1545352705571037275/008CCOGHgy1igpakklklmj32569ed1ky.jpg?ex=6a9bd55c&is=6a9a83dc&hm=69b54af7311cf8174ad781c71bb442d589f3f6baaa05077a91f744302d2dbc92&"}, {"id": "1545352706154176633", "filename": "008CCOGHgy1igpb6hd6kqj30rs29pk1h.jpg", "content_type": "image/jpeg", "size": 382568, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1545352703939579984/1545352706154176633/008CCOGHgy1igpb6hd6kqj30rs29pk1h.jpg?ex=6a9bd55c&is=6a9a83dc&hm=10b059e471d7f14138bd001687ccc464dfbcef5a3091b73fef3194341c16b700&"}], "thread_title": "✦第6章「山宴」关卡流程图总览&无提示事件·星辰篇✦", "forum_channel_id": "1174179624096378930", "thread_tags": ["1181143392739147778"], "is_thread_starter": true}
